Wish for a "blessed figurine of an Archon" and (a)pply it.

In previous versions this wish was much more powerful, because the
Archon would automatically drop his magic weapon and shield of
reflection, which you could then use.  He won't do this anymore, but he
will still defend you quite handily.

Monsters do generally drop stuff when you tame them, though.  My
favorite example was taming a nymph on a bones level that had stolen
all my stuff in a previous game - she then dropped everything at my
feet.  And since I hadn't died with it, it wasn't all cursed!

